    "title": "Man stabbed in SW OKC - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Micah Thompson/KFOR ,\n1 hours ago OKLAHOMA CITY ( KFOR ) — Oklahoma City Police confirmed two males got into a verbal argument inside a business, and one was stabbed around 8:54 p.m. Wednesday night.\nOfficials confirm the wound is non-life-threatening and was transported to OU Medical.\nThe suspect is not in custody at this time.\nThe scene is under further investigation.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KFOR.com Oklahoma City.",
